### UC11 – Complete Tour (happy path, completedAt from clock)
# Prerequisite: start a tour first with UC05, then copy the guideTourId below.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/guide-tours/{{guideTourId}}/complete

### UC11 – Complete Tour (happy path, explicit completedAt)
# Must be at or after the tour's startedAt.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/guide-tours/{{guideTourId}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completedAt": "2026-06-15T17:30:00Z"
}

### UC11 – Error: guide tour not found (404)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/guide-tours/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/complete

### UC11 – Error: invalid state (409)
# Prerequisite: a tour still SCHEDULED (not started), or already FINISHED/CANCELLED.
# complete() requires RUNNING.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/guide-tours/{{guideTourId}}/complete

### UC11 – Error: completed before start (409)
# Prerequisite: a RUNNING tour. Send a completedAt earlier than its startedAt.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/guide-tours/{{guideTourId}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completedAt": "2020-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### UC11 – Error: malformed guideTourId (400)
# UUID.fromString raises IllegalArgumentException, mapped to 400 by GuideExceptionHandler.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/guide-tours/not-a-uuid/complete
